    "detailed_description": "In a village once peaceful, darkness descends when the malevolent Dark Spirit Clan arrives. They took everything from you; it is time for revenge.Curse of the Shadow Samurai is a hack and slash game where you engage waves of increasingly more powerful adversaries as you progress through multiple stages and defeat powerful bosses. Multiple upgrades will be available for you to choose from, transforming you into a more powerful warrior as you complete your vengeance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast paced combat</h2>Dash around the field as you quickly slash and take down your enemies.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple stages</h2>Progress through the game by completing stages, unlocking new enemies and unique maps.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique bosses</h2>Each stage features a unique boss that will test your combat skills.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perks</h2>As you progress through a stage, multiple perks will be available for you to choose from, giving you an advantage in combat by increasing your stats, adding new damage sources, summoning allies, or giving useful utility items. Choose carefully, as you won't be able to get them all.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2>The ultimate challenge, battle through endless waves of enemies and bosses of increasing difficulty. How long will you survive?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your shadow abilities to strike down your enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/d51171917f372ab2cf593d0138fc35d3.poster.avif?t=1687907708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/d51171917f372ab2cf593d0138fc35d3.webm?t=1687907708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/d51171917f372ab2cf593d0138fc35d3.mp4?t=1687907708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be ready to fight multiple types of enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/4e9e37ed9f16df73356451ef95cf4574.poster.avif?t=1687907708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/4e9e37ed9f16df73356451ef95cf4574.webm?t=1687907708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/4e9e37ed9f16df73356451ef95cf4574.mp4?t=1687907708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain powerful upgrades as you progress through enemy waves</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/a56eabf0cc33c640fe0ab150ebab388b.avif?t=1687907708\" /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In a village once peaceful, darkness descends when the malevolent Dark Spirit Clan arrives. They took everything from you; it is time for revenge.Curse of the Shadow Samurai is a hack and slash game where you engage waves of increasingly more powerful adversaries as you progress through multiple stages and defeat powerful bosses. Multiple upgrades will be available for you to choose from, transforming you into a more powerful warrior as you complete your vengeance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast paced combat</h2>Dash around the field as you quickly slash and take down your enemies.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple stages</h2>Progress through the game by completing stages, unlocking new enemies and unique maps.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique bosses</h2>Each stage features a unique boss that will test your combat skills.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perks</h2>As you progress through a stage, multiple perks will be available for you to choose from, giving you an advantage in combat by increasing your stats, adding new damage sources, summoning allies, or giving useful utility items. Choose carefully, as you won't be able to get them all.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2>The ultimate challenge, battle through endless waves of enemies and bosses of increasing difficulty. How long will you survive?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your shadow abilities to strike down your enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/d51171917f372ab2cf593d0138fc35d3.poster.avif?t=1687907708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461010/extras/d51171917f372ab2cf593d0138fc35d3.webm?t=1687907708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst